msgid ""
"<strong>Retrying an old message delivers it today.</strong>\n"
"                        A message that failed a week ago is sent unchanged, and its\n"
"                        recipient receives it now — with a week-old date, price or\n"
"                        link inside. Check the <em>Age (days)</em> column before you\n"
"                        retry, and cancel whatever should never go out.\n"
"                        Only messages in <em>Delivery Failed</em> state are listed and\n"
"                        touched here: sent, pending and already cancelled messages are\n"
"                        never modified."
msgstr ""

