"Messages are sent one at a time, which costs one connection to your mail "
"server each, so at most 50 per run are sent inside the request; the rest "
"wait for the standard mail queue cron, which sends them in a single "
"connection. Untick for large batches, or while the mail server is still "
"unreachable — every attempt then has to time out first."
